## Input

```css
$enabled: true;

@function identity($value) {
  @return $value;
}

.enabled {
  color: red if($enabled, !important, null);
}

.disabled {
  color: red if(false, !important, null);
}

.ordinary {
  color: red identity(!important);
}

.controls {
  color: red !important;
  color: if(style(--enabled: true): red; else: blue) !important;
}

```


